  <div class="section">
    <div class="main-container">
      <div class="container-large align-center section-title">
        <h3 class="display-heading-3 section-heading" style="margin-top:0;">Common Questions</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="w-layout-grid text-grid-halves">
        <div class="w-layout-grid text-grid-vertical">
          <div>
            <h6 class="heading-2">What should I expect?</h6>
            <div class="text-block-4">Your Beauty Therapist will bring everything required to complete your treatment including products and a portable treatment bed (approximately the size of a large yoga mat) that will be set up in your chosen address.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h6 class="heading-4">In what locations are the mobile therapists available?</h6>
            <div class="text-block-3">Right now, locations are limited to Manly, Fairlight, Balgowlah, Balgowlah Heights, Manly Vale, Queenscliff, Clontarf, Mosman, Cammeray, Cremorne, Neutral Bay, Castle Hill, Kellyville, Baulkham Hills, West Pennant Hills, Cherrybrook, Glenhaven and Norwest.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-layout-grid text-grid-vertical">
          <div>
            <h6 class="heading-3">Do I need to provide anything?</h6>
            <div class="text-block">We do ask that you provide your own towels and blanket to keep you comfortable throughout your treatment.<br><br><br></div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h6 class="heading-5">Is there a minimum spend? </h6>
            <div class="text-block-2">Yes, we do have a minimum spend of $100 for all bookings.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-layout-grid text-grid-vertical">
          <div>
            <h6 class="heading-3">What should I do after my appointment?</h6>
            <div class="text-block">Immediately after your appointment, it is advised that you drink 2 glasses of water and be mindful to stay out of the sun if you have had any sensitising treatments.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h6 class="heading-5">Can I book multiple treatments? </h6>
            <div class="text-block-2">Yes you can book multiple treatments for the one booking. For example, try a Facial Treatment, Massage and Eye Brow Wax.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
